Cloud Exit: Seamless Migration from Azure to Alibaba Cloud

This repository provides a comprehensive guide to understanding and implementing Cloud Exit strategies from Microsoft Azure to Alibaba Cloud. Cloud Exit refers to the process of migrating workloads, applications, and data from one cloud provider to another. This guide covers key concepts, best practices, and tools to help IT professionals execute a secure, efficient, and cost-effective migration. Terraform code is included to demonstrate the detailed steps involved in implementing a Cloud Exit strategy.

